<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title || 'Application Submitted | Pastors LMS' %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/global.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/login.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="login-viewport">
    <div class="login-bg-pattern"></div>
    <div class="login-glow-1"></div>
    <div class="login-glow-2"></div>

    <div class="login-card">
      <div class="login-header">
        <div class="success-icon">
          <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/>
            <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h1 class="login-title">Application Submitted!</h1>
        <p class="login-subtitle">Thank you for your interest in our pastoral training program.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="success-content">
        <div class="info-box">
          <h3>Your Application Details</h3>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Name:</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= full_name %></span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Username:</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= username %></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="next-steps">
          <h3>What Happens Next?</h3>
          <ol>
            <li>Your application will be reviewed by our admissions team</li>
            <li>You will receive an email notification once your application is approved</li>
            <li>Use your username <strong><%= username %></strong> to log in after approval</li>
            <li>Begin your theological training journey</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="action-buttons">
          <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">
            Go to Login Page
            <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="login-footer-note">
        “Holding fast the faithful word as taught, that he may be able by sound doctrine to exhort.” — Titus 1:9
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .success-icon {
      color: #1B7A4B;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    .success-content {
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    
    .info-box {
      background: #FDFCFA;
      border: 1px solid #E5DFD5;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    
    .info-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
      color: #4A154B;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    
    .info-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0.5rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #E5DFD5;
    }
    
    .info-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    
    .info-label {
      color: #6B677C;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    
    .info-value {
      color: #181522;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    
    .next-steps {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    
    .next-steps h3 {
      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
      color: #4A154B;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    
    .next-steps ol {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      color: #373347;
    }
    
    .next-steps li {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    
    .action-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  </style>
</body>
</html>